    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game of Planets</i> is a persistent-online <strong>4X MMORTS</strong> where every choice reverberates across a living galaxy of <strong>1 600+ star systems and 10 000+ planets</strong>. Start with a single colony, then <strong>Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate</strong> in real time against thousands of other commanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet-scale logistics</strong> \u2013 route fleets, resources, and population across a vast starmap while cosmic events keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep technology web</strong> \u2013 unlock terra-forming, new ship types, and planet-cracking weapons; no fixed research path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy &amp; intrigue</strong> \u2013 forge alliances, sign research pacts, enforce blockades, or back-stab rivals in a player-driven political layer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic cosmic phenomena</strong> \u2013 meteor storms, rogue comets, and other random events reshape trade routes and battle plans, rewarding commanders who can adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable races &amp; fleets</strong> \u2013 mix ship hulls, modules, and cultural perks to fit your grand strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community at the core</strong> \u2013 in-game messages and an active Discord power treaties, lore events, and dev-roadmap votes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of civilisation\u2014or watch it implode\u2014when your next decision tips the balance of the galaxy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game of Planets</i> is a persistent-online <strong>4X MMORTS</strong> where every choice reverberates across a living galaxy of <strong>1 600+ star systems and 10 000+ planets</strong>. Start with a single colony, then <strong>Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate</strong> in real time against thousands of other commanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet-scale logistics</strong> \u2013 route fleets, resources, and population across a vast starmap while cosmic events keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep technology web</strong> \u2013 unlock terra-forming, new ship types, and planet-cracking weapons; no fixed research path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy &amp; intrigue</strong> \u2013 forge alliances, sign research pacts, enforce blockades, or back-stab rivals in a player-driven political layer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic cosmic phenomena</strong> \u2013 meteor storms, rogue comets, and other random events reshape trade routes and battle plans, rewarding commanders who can adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable races &amp; fleets</strong> \u2013 mix ship hulls, modules, and cultural perks to fit your grand strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community at the core</strong> \u2013 in-game messages and an active Discord power treaties, lore events, and dev-roadmap votes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of civilisation\u2014or watch it implode\u2014when your next decision tips the balance of the galaxy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Galactic-scale 4X MMORTS. Explore 1 600 star systems, colonise worlds, build fleets, and reshape alliances in real time. Master logistics, tech, and diplomacy to outwit thousands of rival commanders and seize control of the stars.",
